	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Mitsumi SIQ-02FVS3 thumbwheel encoder with push (slide) switch, 15 detents, reflow type, body 10.3x11.1 mm, 4 mm high, dial 14.5 mm. Origin is the dial centre. Land pattern per Mitsumi SIQ series datasheet: terminals A, S, C, B along +Y, six frame lands MP, two 1.6 mm holes for the locating bosses. The dial overhangs the board edge towards -Y; keep the board edge on the Cmts.User line or further out. LCSC C2925423.")
